---
title: "Keep a full copy: the switch and its write"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Off
  s1: Turning on
  s2: On
  s3: Save failed, Retry shown
  s4: Turning off
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: presses the switch
  s0 --> s2: another session changes it
  s1 --> s3: the write fails
  s1 --> s2: the write lands
  s2 --> s0: another session changes it
  s2 --> s4: presses the switch
  s3 --> s1: presses the switch or presses Retry
  s4 --> s0: the write lands
  s4 --> s3: the write fails
  s3 --> s4: presses the switch or presses Retry
